label ch30_7:
    [   0] m "You know, high school is a really turbulent time in a lot of people's lives."
    [   1] m "People can get really passionate and dramatic."
    [   2] m "And others have aching hearts and seek attention on social media..."
    [   3] m "But all of the social pressure and hormones can lead to a dark time in people's lives."
    [   4] m "Everyone has a story."
    [   5] m "You may not know what someone is really feeling on the inside."
    [   6] m "Many people who are depressed won't even bother telling the world about it."
    [   7] m "They don't want attention, because they've already given up on the inside."
    [   8] m "Their feeling of worthlessness is so overwhelming that they don't even want people to tell them otherwise."
    [   9] m "Depression comes in many forms, but that is one of them."
    [  10] m "Just, if you think you know someone struggling with depression..."
    [  11] m "You can help just by treating them like they're a good friend."
    [  12] m "Spend time with them, even if they don't feel like doing much."
    [  13] m "And remind them that they always have something to look forward to."
    [  14] m "Making plans in advance, letting them borrow something, or even just saying 'See you at school tomorrow'..."
    [  15] m "All of those things can help your friend make it to the next day."
    [  16] m "I hope being friends with Sayori has given you some perspective on the true face of depression."
    [  17] m "Yeah, she's gone now..."
    [  18] m "But Sayori was never real in the first place."
    [  19] m "You're real."
    [  20] m "Your friends are real."
    [  21] m "And just by being a good person, you can save someone's life."
    [  22] m "As for you..."
    [  23] m "...You don't struggle with depression or anything like that, do you?"
    [  24] m "Because you, too, have people who would want to save your life."
    [  25] m "Maybe they don't express it every day, or maybe they don't even know how to."
    [  26] m "But people do feel that way."
    [  27] m "I promise."
    [  28] m "...Man, humans are complicated!"
    [  29] m "But as long as you're here with me, I'll take care of you, my love."
